# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.net22, WIFID=1 REST=1 MORE_JOBS="com.apple.bluetoothd com.apple.BlueTool",
# connsys_step=17 connsys_bt=2, XNU_SECS=130: the rest of iOS's jobs on demand (so the daemons
# Preferences asks for are there), Bluetooth's own daemon, and Settings opened by a finger.
#
# Run 88 (logs/lancelot-connsys38.log) got the reason Preferences aborts:
#   *** Terminating app due to uncaught exception 'NSInvalidArgumentException', reason:
#   '*** -[__NSPlaceholderDictionary initWithObjects:forKeys:count:]: attempt to insert nil object
#   from objects[3]'
# a second after it opened, while three of its neighbours were missing: accountsd.accountmanager,
# nehelper and corefollowup.agent all failed lookup with error 3 (No such process) because the small
# image only loads the jobs in IOS_JOBS -- mkjobs.py --rest leaves out the rest, and those three were
# not in it. (nehelper is an on-demand job of the system image, accountsd's Mach service is its own,
# followupd's is corefollowup.agent.) That is the first thing to rule out.
#
# Bluetooth: run 89 (logs/lancelot-connsys39.log) got the controller itself -- WMT's function on,
# then six HCI commands answered as a controller answers (reset, local version, BD_ADDR, features,
# buffer sizes, LE buffer sizes), the "bluetooth" registry node, /dev/cu.bluetooth and
# /dev/uart.bluetooth, the com.apple.uart.sk.bluetooth kernel control and the Skywalk pipe. What was
# missing was bluetoothd: mkjobs.py's DENY has "bluetooth" in it, so its job was not in the image.
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 22
/redwood/bin/net_test dhcp en0 waitaddr en0 10
/redwood/bin/net_test lookup com.apple.accountsd.accountmanager
/redwood/bin/net_test lookup com.apple.nehelper
/redwood/bin/net_test lookup com.apple.corefollowup.agent
/redwood/bin/net_test lookup com.apple.server.bluetooth
/redwood/bin/net_test procs accountsd
/redwood/bin/net_test procs nehelper
/redwood/bin/net_test procs followupd
/redwood/bin/net_test procs bluetooth
/redwood/bin/net_test fbwait 60
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 16
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.875 0.71
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 10
/redwood/bin/net_test procs Preferences
/redwood/bin/net_test procs bluetooth
/redwood/bin/fbgrab -log settings 300 0.4
/redwood/bin/net_test end